#showas:虫患
A rather fun and odd scenario. A focus on one particular faction, and it's set to difficulty 7.  This difficulty is good for someone who has spent some time in AI War 2.

This is on the "swirl" map type, with 83 planets. Swarmer AI Type, which uses Guard Posts that spawn numerous weak drones constantly.  Your starting fleet is set to "Doorkicker," which is focused a bit on breaching tactics, with some crowd control and long range firepower to finish it off.

Only two factions, but there is a big focus on the first:

Macrophages, which are giant space bug Harvesters that destroy ships for metal, and return it to their homes, creating new Harvesters and spreading to other planets.

The Zenith Trader is also wandering around as a neutral third party, selling big weapons and defensive items to you or the AI as it goes.  Make sure to visit the Build tab when it is on one of your planets.

This is fairly simple, but the Macrophage Infestation can begin to grow rather quickly, and start to overrun parts of the galaxy if not kept in check.  If it gets bad enough, it can potentially take out the AI Homeworld for you!